      <MissionDesc>THE SAN DIEGO EYE BANK IS DEDICATED TO THE PRESERVATION &amp; RESTORATION OF SIGHT THROUGH THE COLLECTION, PROCESSING AND DISTRIBUTION OF HUMAN OCULAR TISSUE; PROGRESS IN MEDICINE THROUGH THE SUPPORT OF RESEARCH; THE MAINTENANCE OF AN EYE CENTER FOR DIAGNOSTIC EVALUATION AND THERAPY; AND THE SPONSORSHIP OF EDUCATIONAL PROGRAMS FOR THE MEDICAL COMMUNITY AND GENERAL PUBLIC.</MissionDesc>
